  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/100516> ;
  ammitto:remarks "The National Iranian Oil Company (NIOC) is a State-owned and operated entity providing substantial financial resources to the Government of Iran. NIOC holds the production, sale and export monopoly for Iranian oil. The revenue generated by NIOC’s oil sales plays a significant role in funding Iran’s military and the IRGC. The Minister of Oil is Director of the NIOC Board and the Deputy Minister of Oil is the Managing Director of NIOC. Therefore, NIOC provides support to and is owned by the Government of Iran. Furthermore, it provides essential services to the IRGC." .
