  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/100807> ;
  ammitto:remarks "Petropars UK Ltd. is a subsidiary of Petropars Ltd (PPL). Petropars Ltd (PPL) is wholly owned by Naftiran Intertrade Company Ltd (NICO), which belongs to the National Iranian Oil Company (NIOC), an Iranian State-owned company providing support to the Government of Iran. Therefore, Petropars UK Ltd is owned and controlled by an entity providing support to the Government of Iran." .
