  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/101782> ;
  ammitto:remarks "Arsang Safe Trading Co. is instrumental in aiding Russia’s acquisition of Close Range Ballistic Missiles (CRBMs) and unmanned aerial vehicles (UAVs) from Iran through its collaboration with Sahara Thunder. The Supply, Research, and Industry Affairs Section of Iran’s Ministry of Defence and Armed Forces Logistics (MODAFL) oversees these military deals, playing a leading role in Iran’s military research and development efforts." .
