  ammitto:remarks "Aleksandr Andreyevich Zhdanov is a limited partner in UrSeCo Handels GmbH & Co. KG, a German company that supplies high-purity hydrogen chloride (HCl) produced by Wacker Chemie AG, a critical chemical for semiconductor wafer processing, to LLP “United Trading Group” (Kazakhstan). The founder of LLP “United Trading Group”, Alimzhan Bekov, is also a representative of UrSeCo Handels GmbH & Co. KG." ;
