  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/104723> ;
  ammitto:remarks "LLC “Atlant Aero” is a Russian aerospace manufacturer. The company is known for its development of “Orion”, “Lightning-1” and “Lightning-1 II” (Molniya) first-person view (FPV) drones, which are manually guided for precision strikes. LLC “Atlant Aero” contributes to the production of components for advanced combat drones “Orion” and is engaged in creating electronic warfare systems and digital integration systems for loitering munitions." .
