  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/104819> ;
  ammitto:remarks "Vremya-Ch is a military training centre in Moscow that provides military-style education and preparedness programs for law enforcement and military personnel. Its courses cover Unmanned Air Vehicle (UAV) operation, military radio communications, survival skills." .
