  ammitto:remarks "Anastasiya Tarshinova is the general director of LIBBS LLC, a company within the Russian military and industrial complex. The company has acted as an intermediary between JSC IEMZ Kupol, a subsidiary of Russian state-owned arms company Almaz-Antey, and Chinese suppliers manufacturing long-range attack drones of the type Garpiya-A1, which are developed and produced for use in Russia’s war of aggression against Ukraine. Therefore, Anastasiya Tarshinova is materially supporting Russia’s military and industrial complex." .
