  ammitto:remarks "JSC “Krasnoyarsk Machine-Building Plant” is a Russian machine-building company. One of the activities of JSC “Krasnoyarsk Machine-Building Plant” is the production of ballistic missiles and modules for carrier rockets. JSC “Krasnoyarsk Machine-Building Plant” produces the ballistic missile RS-28 “Sarmat”." .
