  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/105130> ;
  ammitto:remarks "Sergey Sakhnenko is the General Director of the holding company JSC United Instrument Manufacturing Corporation, a subsidiary of Rostec. The company manufactures military radio-electronic devices and supplies the Armed Forces of the Russian Federation. JSC United Instrument Manufacturing Corporation controls several dozens of enterprises producing military equipment that is used by the Russian Armed Forces during Russia’s war of aggression against Ukraine." ;
