  ammitto:remarks "Tatyana Khomenko is a co-founder and 33,3  % shareholder of LLC T.R.O.S., listed by the Union, the UK &US, which manufactures metalworking equipment and wholesales machine tools. LLCS T.R.O.S. advertises machining centres with dual-use capabilities and is part of a procurement network aimed at circumventing restrictive measures to supply Union metalworking equipment and machine tools into Russia." .
