<https://www.ammitto.org/entity/ch/105506>
  a ammitto:OrganizationEntity ;
  ammitto:entityType "organization" ;
  ammitto:hasName [ a ammitto:NameVariant ; ammitto:fullName "LLC “KLEVERCOPTER”" ; ammitto:isPrimary "true"^^xsd:boolean ] ;
  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/105506> ;
  ammitto:remarks "LLC “Klevercopter” develops drones for various purposes. In 2023 the company took part in the exhibition by the Ministry of Defence of the Russian Federation “Army 2023”. The company participates in the government procurement process under the Unmanned Aviation Systems national project. One of the drones developed by the company, Kurier-30, received the state certification issued by Chamber of Commerce and Industry and the Ministry of Industry and Trade. Being on the list of certified Russian products allows it to participate in government procurement under the Unmanned Aviation Systems national project, participate in import substitution programs, receive state support to compete with foreign products. Moreover, LLC Klevercopter cooperates with and receives support from the local government of the Nizhny Novgorod region in testing its drones." .
