  ammitto:remarks "LLC “Sky Vortex” is Russia-based distributor of a wide range of certified materials from foreign manufacturers for the repair and maintenance of foreign aircraft. Its client portfolio includes major aviation and aerospace organisations such as Russia’s national carrier Aeroflot, Aeroflot Technics, S7 Airlines, Russian Helicopters, Composite-Products Company which produces auxiliary materials and resins, and A-Technics." .
