<https://www.ammitto.org/entity/ch/105821>
  a ammitto:OrganizationEntity ;
  ammitto:entityType "organization" ;
  ammitto:hasName [ a ammitto:NameVariant ; ammitto:fullName "JSC Technodron" ; ammitto:isPrimary "true"^^xsd:boolean ] ;
  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/105821> ;
  ammitto:remarks "JSC “Technodron” develops and manufactures first-person view (FPV) drones of the Skvorec (a.k.a. Skvorets, Starling) family. With the support of the Center for Unmanned Systems and Technologies, this product is constantly being developed to expand the range of tasks to be solved. Since 2024, drones Skvorec-7, Skvorec-10, Skvorec-Z and Skvorec-PRO have been used by the Russian forces in the Russia’s war of aggression against Ukraine. By order of the Russian Navy, the company developed the “Starling of the Navy” (Skvorec Navy) for water area related tasks. JSC “Technodron” is therefore materially supporting Russia’s military and industrial complex." .
<https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/105821>
