<https://www.ammitto.org/entity/ch/107477>
  a ammitto:OrganizationEntity ;
  ammitto:entityType "organization" ;
  ammitto:hasName [ a ammitto:NameVariant ; ammitto:fullName "LLC Izovac" ; ammitto:isPrimary "true"^^xsd:boolean ] ;
  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/107477> ;
  ammitto:remarks "LLC Izovac is a Belarusian developer and manufacturer of vacuum equipment, film technologies, ion sources, sputtering technology and related software. The company was included in the Registry of the Military-Industrial Complex of Russia. In Russia, Izovac is represented by its partner LLC Engineering Group. Izovac, together with its affiliated companies under the same group name, has supplied Russian defence contractors that have received about USD 200 million worth of goods from Izovac since the beginning of the full-scale Russian invasion of Ukraine. LLC Izovac is therefore materially supporting Russia’s military and industrial complex, including by being involved in the development, production or supply of military technology and equipment." .
