<https://www.ammitto.org/entity/ch/107604>
  a ammitto:OrganizationEntity ;
  ammitto:entityType "organization" ;
  ammitto:hasName [ a ammitto:NameVariant ; ammitto:fullName "CJSC “Gefest and T”" ; ammitto:isPrimary "true"^^xsd:boolean ] ;
  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/107604> ;
  ammitto:remarks "CJSC “Gefest and T” develops and manufactures high-tech products for aircraft, including for military aircraft. The company computing subsystems SVP-24 “Gefest” are installed on the carriers of guided bombs (including Su-34, Su-35S, Su-24M) and are used to calculate the parameters of the aircraft’s flight and the point of release of bombs. This system is currently used on many strike aircraft of the Russian Aerospace Forces. Therefore, CJSC “Gefest and T” materially supports Russia’s military and industrial complex including by being involved in the development, production and supply of military technology and equipment." .
