  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/13334> ;
  ammitto:remarks "Head of the administrative justice court until Apr 2021. He was complicit in the repression of peaceful demonstrators in 2009 as head of the judiciary branch of the armed forces." .
