  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/27753> ;
  ammitto:remarks "On 17 Mar 2014, the \"Parliament of Crimea\" adopted a resolution declaring the appropriation of assets belonging to Chernomorneftegaz enterprise on behalf of the \"Republic of Crimea\". The enterprise is thus effectively confiscated by the Crimean \"authorities\". Re-registered on 29 Nov 2014 as State Unitary Enterprise of the \"Republic of Crimea\" \"Chernomorneftegaz\" (Государственное унитарное предприятие Республики Крым \"Черноморнефтегаз\"). Founder: The Ministry of Fuel and Energy of the \"Republic of Crimea\" (Министерство топлива и энергетики \"Республики Крым\")." .
