  ammitto:remarks "Owner/Manager of the Compagnie Aérienne des Grands Lacs and of Great Lakes Business Company, whose aircraft were used to provide assistance to armed groups and militias referred to in paragraph 20 of Res.1493 (2003). Also responsible for disguising information on flights and cargo apparently to allow for the violation of the arms embargo." ;
