  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/38644> ;
  ammitto:remarks "Deputy Director General of the Scientific Studies and Research Centre (SSRC), which is responsible for the development and production of non-conventional weapons, including chemical weapons, and the missiles to deliver them. Due to his senior position at SSRC, he is associated with the designated entity SSRC." .
