<https://www.ammitto.org/entity/ch/41390>
  a ammitto:OrganizationEntity ;
  ammitto:entityType "organization" ;
  ammitto:hasName [ a ammitto:NameVariant ; ammitto:fullName "Al Qatarji Company" ; ammitto:isPrimary "true"^^xsd:boolean ] ;
  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/41390> ;
  ammitto:remarks "Prominent company operating across multiple sectors of the Syrian economy. By facilitating fuel, arms and ammunition trade between the former al-Assad regime and various actors including ISIL (Da’esh) under the pretext of importing and exporting food items, supporting militias fighting alongside the former al-Assad regime and taking advantage of its ties with the former al-Assad regime to expand its commercial activity, Al Qatarji Company – whose board is headed by designated person Hussam Al Qatarji, a member of the Syrian People’s Assembly – supports and benefits from the former al-Assad regime." .
