  ammitto:remarks "Has actively undermined democracy in Belarus. Former Сhairman of the Regional Electoral Commission of the Grodno district. As Chairman of a Regional Electoral Commission, he was directly responsible for the violations of international electoral standards in the Presidential elections, in particular in 2006 in the Grodno region." ;
