  ammitto:remarks "Thet Thet Khine was the Minister of Social Welfare, Relief and Resettlement from 4 February 2021 to 3 August 2023 and Minister for Hotels and Tourism from 3 August 2023 to 31 July 2025. She was appointed by the State Administrative Council (SAC), led by Commander-in-Chief Min Aung Hlaing, which took over the legislative, executive and judicial powers of the State as of 2 February 2021." ;
