  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/47798> ;
  ammitto:remarks "No 1 Mining Enterprise (ME 1) is a state-owned enterprise (SOE) operating under the Ministry of Natural Resources and Environmental Conservation (MONREC) that also acts as the regulator for the sector of non-ferrous metal production and marketing. As such, the SOE is endowed with the responsibility to grant permits and collect part of the tax on profits made by private companies that are either in “production-sharing contracts” or in joint venture with ME 1." .
