  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/5307> ;
  ammitto:remarks "Judge of the City Court of Minsk. As chief judge, he dismissed the appeals against the sentences of political and civil society activists Dmitri Dashkevich, Eduard Lobov, Aleksandr Otroshchenkov, Dmitri Novik, Aleksandr Molchanov. These trials were a clear violation of the Code of Criminal Procedure." ;
