  ammitto:remarks "JSC Baltic Shipbuilding Plant “Yantar” (a.k.a. Yantar Shipyard) is part of the United Shipbuilding Corporation, a Russian state-owned shipbuilding conglomerate which is the main provider of the military warships to the Russian Navy." .
