  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/54475> ;
  ammitto:remarks "Vital Aleksin is the son of Aliaksei Aleksin, a prominent Belarusian businessman. In 2021 he became the co-owner of companies owned by or associated with his father, including Energo-Oil, Belneftgaz and Grantlo (formerly Energo-Oil-Invest). Those companies were given preferential treatment based on presidential decrees signed by Aliaksandr Lukashenka: Inter Tobacco was given exclusive privileges to import tobacco products to Belarus, while Belneftgaz was appointed national transit monitoring operator. He is therefore benefitting from the Lukashenka regime." ;
  ammitto:birthInfo [ a ammitto:BirthInfo ; ammitto:date "1997-08-29"^^xsd:date ; ammitto:circa "false"^^xsd:boolean ; ammitto:year "1997"^^xsd:integer ] .
