  ammitto:remarks "Former so-called mayor of Enerhodar. Organised the creation of “a council of self-organisation” of the city of Enerhodar on 27 March 2022, which was not supported by the Ukrainian authorities. He is now an employee of the Zaporozhye NPP." ;
