  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/56318> ;
  ammitto:remarks "Nikolay Velikdan has been the Chairman of the Stavropol Regional Duma since 30 September 2021. He is a member of the Stavropol Regional Duma since 19 September 2021 and former first Deputy Chairman of the Government of the Stavropol Territory. He is a member of the Kremlin-aligned ruling party “United Russia” and member of the Presidium of the Regional Political Council of the Party." ;
