  ammitto:hasName [ a ammitto:NameVariant ; ammitto:fullName "Svistunova Valiantsina Mikalaeuna" ; ammitto:isPrimary "true"^^xsd:boolean ] ;
  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/5718> ;
  ammitto:remarks "Judge at Central District Court of Minsk. In 2010–2011 she fined or sentenced the following representatives of civil society for their peaceful protests: a) 2011.07.21, Bandarenka Volha, 10 days in prison; b) 2011.07.21, Ruskaya Volha, 11 days in prison; c) 2010.12.20, Marchyk Stanislaw, 15 days in prison; d) 2010.12.20, Stanchyk Alyaksandr, 10 days in prison; e) 2010.12.20, Anyankow Syarhey, 10 days in prison. Repeatedly imposed prison terms against those involved in peaceful protests and, as a result, she was responsible for the repression of civil society and of the democratic opposition in Belarus." .
