  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/57672> ;
  ammitto:remarks "Désiré Londroma Ndjukpa is a leader of the Cooperative for Development of the Congo/Union of Revolutionaries for the Defence of the Congolese People (CODECO URDPC), identified as its defence officer (“charge of defence”), and co-leader of its political wing." .
