<https://www.ammitto.org/entity/ch/5794>
  a ammitto:PersonEntity ;
  ammitto:entityType "person" ;
  ammitto:hasName [ a ammitto:NameVariant ; ammitto:fullName "Alinikau Siarhei Aliaksandravich" ; ammitto:isPrimary "true"^^xsd:boolean ] ;
  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/5794> ;
  ammitto:remarks "Major, head of operative unit of penal colony IK-17 in Shklov. Exerted pressure on political prisoners by denying their rights to correspondence and meetings, issued orders to subject them to a stricter penal regime, searches, and made threats in order to extort confessions. He was directly responsible for violating the human rights of political prisoners and opposition activists in 2011–2012 by using excessive force against them. His actions constituted a direct violation of the international commitments of Belarus in the field of human rights." .
