  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/60415> ;
  ammitto:remarks "The National Wealth Fund of the Russian Federation is a reserve fund controlled by the government. According to the Ministry of Finance, the fund had RUB 13,6 trillion, equal to 10.2 % of Russia’s gross domestic product initially projected for 2022." .
