  ammitto:remarks "The Foundation for the Support and Protection of the Rights of Compatriots Living Abroad is founded and financed by the Russian Federation with the aim of fulfilling the foreign policy goals of the Russian Government. It represents a unique structure of Russia’s “soft power”, which plays an important supporting role in implementing the Russian Government politics of division." .
