  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/63231> ;
  ammitto:remarks "TV and Radio Company of the Armed Forces of the Russian Federation Zvezda is an organisation controlled by Russia’s Ministry of Defence and financed by the Russian state. The company runs a military-patriotic TV channel “Zvezda” devoted to supporting and promoting Russia’s military, and spreads disinformation and propaganda about Russia’s war of aggression against Ukraine." .
