  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/63581> ;
  ammitto:remarks "“Plant ‘Zvezda’” is Russia’s leading enterprise for the production of high-precision gyroscopic devices for rocket, space and aviation equipment for various purposes. The plant is a part of the military-industrial complex in Tver region that solves high-tech tasks in the interests of the Ministry of Defense of the Russian Federation." .
