  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/69855> ;
  ammitto:remarks "Valery Revenko is the Head of the Department of International Military Cooperation of the Republic of Belarus - Assistant to the Minister of Defence of the Republic of Belarus for International Military Cooperation. The Department of International Military Cooperation of\nthe Ministry of Defence of the Republic of Belarus manages the activities of the armed forces in the organisation and implementation of international military cooperation and arms control." ;
