  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/7028> ;
  ammitto:remarks "Senior army figure directly involved in the terror campaign waged before and during the elections, including violence and torture against civilians in the diamond fields and  threatening a coup if the MDC won the elections. Linked to violence in Chinhoyi in 2008." .
