<https://www.ammitto.org/entity/ch/70575>
  a ammitto:OrganizationEntity ;
  ammitto:entityType "organization" ;
  ammitto:hasName [ a ammitto:NameVariant ; ammitto:fullName "JSC “Alabuga” Special Economic Zone of Industrial and Production Type" ; ammitto:isPrimary "true"^^xsd:boolean ] ;
  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/70575> ;
  ammitto:remarks "JSC “Alabuga” Special Economic Zone of Industrial and Production Type is responsible for the Alabuga special economic zone (SEZ) in the Russian Federation (Tatarstan) that was established in 2006. The Alabuga SEZ hosts manufacturing facilities including SuperCam, Aviatest Aero and Albatros that assemble unmanned aerial vehicles (UAVs). Those facilities are part of a Russian State-backed programme and have been set up with assistance from Iran in the training of staff and supply of material in order to assemble military drones for use in Russia’s war of aggression against Ukraine. The UAVs (Shahed-136) produced in the Alabuga SEZ with the financing of the State-owned VTB Banking Group are used by the Russian army in Ukraine. Therefore, JSC “Alabuga” is associated with JSC Albatros, AviatestAero and SuperCam Unmanned Systems Group." .
