  ammitto:remarks "Yasser Ibrahim is an economic advisor to Bashar al-Assad and acts in the economic council run by Asma al-Assad. Together with Ali Najib Ibrahim he operates a number of shell companies, and acts as a front for business activities of Bashar al-Assad and Asma al-Assad. Therefore, Yasser Ibrahim is benefitting from and supporting the former al-Assad regime." ;
  ammitto:birthInfo [ a ammitto:BirthInfo ; ammitto:date "1983-04-09"^^xsd:date ; ammitto:circa "false"^^xsd:boolean ; ammitto:year "1983"^^xsd:integer ] .
