  ammitto:remarks "Boris Vologdin is the General Director of JSC Tomsk Electrotechnical Plant. The company is a supplier of the Armed Forces of the Russian Federation. JSC Tomsk Electrotechnical Plant modernises T-90 with the cooperation and under the management of its parent company Uralvagonzavod." ;
