  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/72507> ;
  ammitto:remarks "Igor Bekbulatov is the General Director of Corporation Proekttechnika, a Russian military industry company. The company produces special purpose vehicles, such as MTP-A2.7 and MTPA2.1, which are used by the Russian Armed Forces in the war of aggression against Ukraine." .
