  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/73006> ;
  ammitto:remarks "OJSC Krasnoe Znamya provides services for the assembly and installation of printed circuit boards. OJSC Krasnoe Znamya Plant is one of the largest enterprises of the military-industrial complex of Russia in the field of development and serial production of high-tech products of radio engineering profile and high-precision electronic equipment." .
