  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/73547> ;
  ammitto:remarks "Defense Industries System (DIS), previously known as the Military Industrial Corporation (MIC), is a large Sudanese Armed Forces (SAF)-owned conglomerate which manages a network of military-controlled companies. DIS generates substantial annual revenues, estimated at USD 2 billion in 2020." .
