  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/75106> ;
  ammitto:remarks "The Tallamkho Design Bureau (“Pathfinder”) was established in 2022 and is based in Grozny, Chechen Republic. The organisation specialises in dual-purpose IT developments and operates under the auspices of the team of Chechnya’s head Ramzan Kadyrov." .
