  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/77731> ;
  ammitto:remarks "Pavel Kazakou is the head of the correctional institution Prison No 1 in Grodno, where the political prisoner Ales Pushkin and the artist Ruslan Karchauli died due to not receiving proper medical care. Other prisoners detained in that institution testified to the inhumane conditions." ;
