  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/78529> ;
  ammitto:remarks "Shahid Haj Ali Movahed Research Center is a subsidiary of the EU-listed Shahid Hemmat Industries Group (SHIG), an industrial group subordinate to the state-controlled EU-listed Aerospace Industries Organisation (AIO), which supports Iran’s liquid-propellant ballistic missile programme." .
