<https://www.ammitto.org/entity/ch/85994>
  a ammitto:OrganizationEntity ;
  ammitto:entityType "organization" ;
  ammitto:hasName [ a ammitto:NameVariant ; ammitto:fullName "Joint Stock Company Tula Machine Building Plant" ; ammitto:isPrimary "true"^^xsd:boolean ] ;
  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/85994> ;
  ammitto:remarks "JSC Tula Machine Building Plant is a Russian defence manufacturer with a specialisation in the production of advanced military equipment, particularly in the domain of anti-aircraft weaponry and artillery systems. The company is responsible for the development and manufacturing of several key defence systems, including the KASHTAN anti-aircraft missile and artillery system, the PALMA anti-aircraft artillery system, and a range of 30 mm automatic cannons and machine guns such as the Gryazev-Shipunov GSh-6-30 and the 2A72. These systems are integrated into various military platforms, including infantry fighting vehicles such as the BMP-3 and BTR-80A, and are also mounted on strategic assets such as the Kuznetsov class aircraft carrier." .
