<https://www.ammitto.org/entity/ch/86763>
  a ammitto:OrganizationEntity ;
  ammitto:entityType "organization" ;
  ammitto:hasName [ a ammitto:NameVariant ; ammitto:fullName "Juhang Aviation Technology Shenzhen Co. Limited" ; ammitto:isPrimary "true"^^xsd:boolean ] ;
  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/86763> ;
  ammitto:remarks "Juhang Aviation Technology Shenzhen Co. Limited (Juhang Aviation) is a Chinese company involved in a procurement and manufacturing network for the Russian military-industrial complex. Through a Russian intermediary, OOO TSK Vektor, Juhang Aviation has delivered components to IEMZ Kupol, a subsidiary of Russian state-owned arms company Almaz-Antey, which subsequently were used for manufacturing long-range attack drones of the type Garpiya-3 (G3) for use in Russia’s war of aggression against Ukraine. This also includes components from Xiamen Limbach, a Chinese entity producing L550 drone engines." .
