<https://www.ammitto.org/entity/ch/86918>
  a ammitto:OrganizationEntity ;
  ammitto:entityType "organization" ;
  ammitto:hasName [ a ammitto:NameVariant ; ammitto:fullName "JSC “Research and Production Corporation “Precision Instrumentation Systems”" ; ammitto:isPrimary "true"^^xsd:boolean ] ;
  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/86918> ;
  ammitto:remarks "JSC “Research and Production Corporation ‘Precision Instrumentation Systems’”, also known as JSC “NPK ‘SPP’”, is one of the main military-industrial companies in Russia. In particular, it produces aircraft systems such as SEER, MOS, OES-52, OLS-container and OLS. These aircraft systems are being used in Russian military aircraft such as SU-27 and attack helicopter KA-52, used by the Russian Armed Forces in Russia’s war of aggression against Ukraine." .
