  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/88634> ;
  ammitto:remarks "Fidail Bikbulatov is the Head of the Regional Headquarters of the All-Russia “Young Army” Military Patriotic Social Movement (Yunarmiya) in the illegally occupied Zaporizhzhia region. He was involved in the mass abduction, illegal deportation and forced transfer of Ukrainian children from occupied territories of Ukraine to Russia." ;
