  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/89159> ;
  ammitto:remarks "Dmitry Lelikov is Deputy General Director of Rostec and a member of Rostec’s Management Board. Rostec is a key company within the Russian military-industrial complex and produces various types of defence hardware and equipment in use by the Russian Armed Forces in their war of aggression against Ukraine." ;
