  ammitto:remarks "Mikalai Shkred is the First Deputy Head of the Belarus President Property Management Directorate and a former Deputy Head of the Security Service of Aliaksandr Lukashenka. The Directorate is a Belarusian government body subordinated directly to Aliaksandr Lukashenka. The Directorate started as a small unit managing inventory, logistics and welfare for government agencies, and has since evolved into the largest operator of non-residential real estate and of lotteries in Belarus. It thereby generates revenue for the regime." ;
  ammitto:birthInfo [ a ammitto:BirthInfo ; ammitto:date "1981-04-26"^^xsd:date ; ammitto:circa "false"^^xsd:boolean ; ammitto:year "1981"^^xsd:integer ] .
