  ammitto:remarks "JSC UAP “Gidravlika” is a military company that is part of the Technodinamika holding of the State Corporation Rostec and functions as a developer and manufacturer of products for aviation and military equipment, such as MS-21, Il-114, Su-57 and Il-96-400M." .
