  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/9460> ;
  ammitto:remarks "Engineering firm involved in supporting a range of large-scale industrial projects including Iran’s uranium enrichment programme, including undeclared work at the uranium enrichment site at Qom/Fordow." .
