  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/94722> ;
  ammitto:remarks "Rukhservomotor LLC is a Belarusian company which focuses on the development and manufacturing of precision coordinate systems. It supplies companies which are military end-users with goods with military end-use. The company participates in the production of panoramic sights (PKP) for Russian T-72 and T-90 tanks." .
