<https://www.ammitto.org/entity/ch/95209>
  a ammitto:OrganizationEntity ;
  ammitto:entityType "organization" ;
  ammitto:hasName [ a ammitto:NameVariant ; ammitto:fullName "Joint Stock Company “Aleksinsky Experimental Mechanical Plant”" ; ammitto:isPrimary "true"^^xsd:boolean ] ;
  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/ch/consolidated-list/95209> ;
  ammitto:remarks "JSC “Aleksinsky Experimental Mechanical Plant” produces weapons in Tula in the Russian Federation. It was added to the list of strategic organisations of the Russian Government in 2022. The company is part of the Russian military and industrial complex and supports it materially, including by being involved in the development, production and supply of military technology and equipment. The Deputy Head of the Security Council of the Russian Federation visited JSC “Aleksinsky Experimental Mechanical Plant” to inspect weapons production, and the company hosted a meeting of the working group of the Military-Industrial Commission of the Russian Federation. The recognition of JSC “Aleksinsky Experimental Mechanical Plant” and the involvement of the Russian Government demonstrate its strategic importance in the Russian defence sector." .
