  ammitto:remarks "Intershipping Services LLC is an entity based in the UAE. It operates the Gabon international flag registry, which has been flagging vessels transporting Russian crude oil or petroleum products following the beginning of Russia’s war of aggression against Ukraine, including vessels controlled by Sovcomflot." .
